    "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
    "text": "Brijendra Singh Ola is a senior leader from Jhunjhunu district in Rajasthan. He is serving as Member of Parliament, Lok Sabha for Jhunjhunu since 2024. He is elected as the member of Rajasthan Legislative Assembly from 2008 till 2024. He is former State Minister of Transport and Road Safety in the Government of Rajasthan. He is a fourth term former member of the Rajasthan Legislative Assembly from the Jhunjhunu Assembly constituency. He is a member of Indian National Congress.",
